<section class="band alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="contact-direct">carmelito@communitygeeks.de</p>
        <p class="contact-note">Direct, no form required if you'd rather just write.</p>
      </div>
      {# Backend: Formspree (decided — see HANDOFF.md "Remaining ambiguities", item 1).
         TODO (Carmelito): replace YOUR_FORM_ID below with the real endpoint from your
         Formspree dashboard (Forms → your form → Integration → copy the form ID out of
         the "https://formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX" endpoint it gives you) once the account
         exists. Until then this form will not actually send anywhere. #}
      <form class="form-mock" action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID" method="POST">
        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <label for="message">What's going on with your ecosystem?</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
        </div>
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary" style="align-self:flex-start;border:none;cursor:pointer;">Send</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

